[60.551934, "o", "\r\u001b[2KI need to install build dependencies, then build STP and KLEE against LLVM 16. First let me prepare the environment and check network access.\r\n\r\n```\r\nexport DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive\r\napt-get update -y >/tmp/apt-update.log 2>&1 && echo apt-update-ok || { tail -100 /tmp/apt-update.log; exit 1; }\r\napt-get install -y -q build-essential cmake ninja-build git curl wget python3 python3-pip bison flex file pkg-config ca-certificates >/tmp/apt-install1.log 2>&1\r\n&& echo basics-ok || { tail -100 /tmp/apt-install1.log; exit 1; }\r\ncmake --version | head -1; g++ --version | head -1; git --version; curl --version | head -1\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[60.552269, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
