[74.11887, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m6\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\u001b[2K```\r\ncd /app/klee-src && sed -n '1,220p' README.md; echo '--- Dockerfile'; sed -n '1,240p' Dockerfile; echo '--- deps grep'; grep -R \"STP\\|uclibc\\|libcxx\\|z3\" -n \r\ndocs/README* docs/*.rst README-CMake.md 2>/dev/null | head -100\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
