[80.081153, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m9\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠴\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\u001b[2K```\r\ncd /app/klee-src && cat README-CMake.md\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠴\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
