[95.867372, "o", "\r\u001b[2KSources are ready. Now I'll build MiniSat and STP into `/opt/klee`, following KLEE's build configuration.\r\n\r\n```\r\nset -e\r\nmkdir -p /opt/klee /app/build\r\nrm -rf /app/build/minisat /opt/klee/minisat\r\nmkdir -p /app/build/minisat\r\ncd /app/build/minisat\r\ncmake -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/opt/klee/minisat /app/minisat-src > /tmp/minisat-cmake.log 2>&1\r\nmake -j\"$(nproc)\" > /tmp/minisat-build.log 2>&1\r\nmake install > /tmp/minisat-install.log 2>&1\r\necho minisat-installed\r\nfind /opt/klee/minisat -maxdepth 3 -type f | sort | head -30\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠴\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[95.86773, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠴\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[97.693262, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[97.693543, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\nminisat-installed\r\n/opt/klee/minisat/bin/minisat\r\n/opt/klee/minisat/bin/minisat_core\r\n/opt/klee/minisat/lib/libminisat.so.2.1.0\r\n\r\n"]
