[102.772037, "o", "\r\u001b[2KMiniSat installed successfully. Next, configure and build STP with the no-Boost simple configuration used by KLEE's CI.\r\n\r\n```\r\nset -e\r\nrm -rf /app/build/stp /opt/klee/stp\r\nmkdir -p /app/build/stp\r\ncd /app/build/stp\r\ncmake \\\r\n  -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release \\\r\n  -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/opt/klee/stp \\\r\n  -DCMAKE_PREFIX_PATH=/opt/klee/minisat \\\r\n  -DBUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON \\\r\n  -DNO_BOOST:BOOL=ON \\\r\n  -DENABLE_PYTHON_INTERFACE:BOOL=OFF \\\r\n  -DONLY_SIMPLE:BOOL=ON \\\r\n  -DNOCRYPTOMINISAT=ON \\\r\n  /app/stp-src > /tmp/stp-cmake.log 2>&1 || { tail -100 /tmp/stp-cmake.log; exit 1; }\r\nmake -j\"$(nproc)\" > /tmp/stp-build.log 2>&1 || { tail -200 /tmp/stp-build.log; exit 1; }\r\nmake install > /tmp/stp-install.log 2>&1 || { tail -100 /tmp/stp-install.log; exit 1; }\r\necho stp-installed\r\nfind /opt/klee/stp -maxdepth 3 \\( -type f -o -type l \\) | sort | head -60\r\necho '--- stp version'; /opt/klee/stp/bin/stp --version 2>&1 | head -20\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠴\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[102.772293, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠴\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
