[129.643268, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe system LLVM 16 has RTTI enabled and exceptions disabled, matching KLEE's requirements. I'll now configure KLEE with STP support and POSIX/uClibc disabled, \r\nusing the freestanding runtime.\r\n\r\n```\r\nnproc; free -h; cd /app && rm -rf build/klee && mkdir -p build/klee\r\ncd /app/build/klee\r\ncmake -S /app/klee-src -B /app/build/klee \\\r\n  -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release \\\r\n  -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/opt/klee \\\r\n  -DLLVM_DIR=/usr/lib/llvm-16/lib/cmake/llvm \\\r\n  -DLLVMCC=/usr/bin/clang-16 \\\r\n  -DLLVMCXX=/usr/bin/clang++-16 \\\r\n  -DENABLE_SOLVER_STP=ON \\\r\n  -DSTP_DIR=/opt/klee/stp/lib/cmake/STP \\\r\n  -DENABLE_SOLVER_Z3=OFF \\\r\n  -DENABLE_SOLVER_METASMT=OFF \\\r\n  -DENABLE_POSIX_RUNTIME=OFF \\\r\n  -DENABLE_KLEE_LIBCXX=OFF \\\r\n  -DENABLE_KLEE_EH_CXX=OFF \\\r\n  -DENABLE_TCMALLOC=OFF \\\r\n  -DENABLE_UNIT_TESTS=OFF \\\r\n  -DENABLE_SYSTEM_TESTS=OFF \\\r\n  -DENABLE_DOCS=OFF \\\r\n  > /tmp/klee-cmake.log 2>&1 || { tail -150 /tmp/klee-cmake.log; exit 1; }\r\ntail -80 /tmp/klee-cmake.log\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
