[133.407239, "o", "\r\u001b[2KKLEE configured successfully with STP and no POSIX/uClibc runtime. I'll build and install it now.\r\n\r\n```\r\nset -o pipefail\r\ncd /app/build/klee\r\nmake -j\"$(nproc)\" > /tmp/klee-build.log 2>&1 || { tail -250 /tmp/klee-build.log; exit 1; }\r\nmake install > /tmp/klee-install.log 2>&1 || { tail -150 /tmp/klee-install.log; exit 1; }\r\necho klee-built-and-installed\r\nfind /opt/klee -maxdepth 2 -type d | sort | head -50\r\necho '--- binaries'; find /opt/klee -maxdepth 2 -type f -perm -111 | sort | head -50\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠼\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
