[164.844865, "o", "\r\u001b[2KKLEE runs and reports STP as the default solver backend. I'll now configure `~/.bashrc` and run an end-to-end symbolic execution test.\r\n\r\n```\r\necho '--- .bashrc'; nl -ba ~/.bashrc; echo '--- .profile'; nl -ba ~/.profile\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠼\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
