[172.3593, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m23\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠹\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[172.360421, "o", "\r\u001b[2KI'll add the environment setup at the very top of `~/.bashrc`, before its non-interactive early return, so sourcing it always exposes KLEE, its headers through \r\n`CPATH`, and its shared libraries.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncp ~/.bashrc ~/.bashrc.klee-backup\r\ncat > /tmp/klee-bashrc-header <<'EOF'\r\n# KLEE symbolic execution tool environment\r\nexport PATH=\"/opt/klee/bin${PATH:+:$PATH}\"\r\nexport CPATH=\"/opt/klee/include${CPATH:+:$CPATH}\"\r\nexport LD_LIBRARY_PATH=\"/opt/klee/lib:/opt/klee/stp/lib:/opt/klee/minisat/lib${LD_LIBRARY_PATH:+:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH}\"\r\nEOF\r\ncat /tmp/klee-bashrc-header ~/.bashrc.klee-backup > ~/.bashrc\r\nchmod 644 ~/.bashrc\r\necho '--- top of bashrc'; head -10 ~/.bashrc\r\necho '--- source test'; /bin/bash -c 'source ~/.bashrc; echo PATH=$PATH; echo CPATH=$CPATH; echo LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$LD_LIBRARY_PATH; command -v klee; klee \r\n--version; printf \"#include <klee/klee.h>\\nint main(void){return 0;}\\n\" > /tmp/header_test.c; clang-16 -fsyntax-only /tmp/header_test.c && echo header-ok'\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠹\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[172.36047, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠹\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[172.409472, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[172.409749, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\n--- top of bashrc\r\n# KLEE symbolic execution tool environment\r\nexport PATH=\"/opt/klee/bin${PATH:+:$PATH}\"\r\nexport CPATH=\"/opt/klee/include${CPATH:+:$CPATH}\"\r\nexport LD_LIBRARY_PATH=\"/opt/klee/lib:/opt/klee/stp/lib:/opt/klee/minisat/lib${LD_LIBRARY_PATH:+:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH}\"\r\n# ~/.bashrc: executed by bash(1) for non-login shells.\r\n# see /usr/share/doc/bash/examples/startup-files (in the package bash-doc)\r\n# for examples\r\n\r\n# If not running interactively, don't do anything\r\n[ -z \"$PS1\" ] && return\r\n--- source test\r\nPATH=/opt/klee/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin\r\nCPATH=/opt/klee/include\r\nLD_LIBRARY_PATH=/opt/klee/lib:/opt/klee/stp/lib:/opt/klee/minisat/lib\r\n/opt/klee/bin/klee\r\nKLEE 3.3 (https://klee-se.org/)\r\n  Build mode: Release (Asserts: ON)\r\n  Build revision: 74f49f1d243f0e1692a00ac688a7b805b37c5646\r\n\r\nUbuntu LLVM version 16.0.6\r\n  Optimized build.\r\nheader-ok\r\n\r\n"]
