[177.589765, "o", "\r\u001b[2KEnvironment variables and header inclusion work. I'll run a complete symbolic-execution smoke test with a KLEE-generated test case.\r\n\r\n```\r\nrm -rf /tmp/klee-smoke && mkdir -p /tmp/klee-smoke && cd /tmp/klee-smoke\r\ncat > test.c <<'EOF'\r\n#include <klee/klee.h>\r\nint main(void) {\r\n  int x;\r\n  klee_make_symbolic(&x, sizeof(x), \"x\");\r\n  if (x == 42)\r\n    return 0;\r\n  else\r\n    return 1;\r\n}\r\nEOF\r\n/bin/bash -c 'source ~/.bashrc; set -e; cd /tmp/klee-smoke; clang-16 -emit-llvm -c -g -O0 -Xclang -disable-O0-optnone test.c -o test.bc; klee \r\n--output-dir=/tmp/klee-smoke/klee-out test.bc' > /tmp/klee-smoke/run.log 2>&1 || { cat /tmp/klee-smoke/run.log; exit 1; }\r\necho '--- KLEE output'; cat /tmp/klee-smoke/run.log\r\necho '--- generated tests'; find /tmp/klee-smoke/klee-out -maxdepth 2 -type f | sort | head -30\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
