[189.111143, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m25\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠹\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[189.111338, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe end-to-end test succeeded: KLEE used STP/MiniSat and generated two test cases. I'll also expose the STP and MiniSat binaries on `PATH` and verify both the \r\nKLEE and STP command-line tools from a newly sourced shell.\r\n\r\n```\r\nln -sf /opt/klee/stp/bin/stp_simple /opt/klee/stp/bin/stp\r\nsed -i 's|export PATH=\"/opt/klee/bin${PATH:+:$PATH}\"|export PATH=\"/opt/klee/bin:/opt/klee/stp/bin:/opt/klee/minisat/bin${PATH:+:$PATH}\"|' ~/.bashrc\r\nhead -5 ~/.bashrc\r\necho '--- noninteractive source checks'; /bin/bash -c 'source ~/.bashrc; command -v klee; command -v stp; command -v minisat; echo \"CPATH=$CPATH\"; stp --version\r\n2>&1 | head -10; klee --help 2>&1 | grep -A2 -- \"--solver-backend\" | head -5'\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠹\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[189.113313, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠹\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[189.161325, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[189.161808, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\n# KLEE symbolic execution tool environment\r\nexport PATH=\"/opt/klee/bin:/opt/klee/stp/bin:/opt/klee/minisat/bin${PATH:+:$PATH}\"\r\nexport CPATH=\"/opt/klee/include${CPATH:+:$CPATH}\"\r\nexport LD_LIBRARY_PATH=\"/opt/klee/lib:/opt/klee/stp/lib:/opt/klee/minisat/lib${LD_LIBRARY_PATH:+:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH}\"\r\n# ~/.bashrc: executed by bash(1) for non-login shells.\r\n--- noninteractive source checks\r\n/opt/klee/bin/klee\r\n/opt/klee/stp/bin/stp\r\n/opt/klee/minisat/bin/minisat\r\nCPATH=/opt/klee/include\r\nFatal Error: Cannot open --version\r\nSTP Error: Cannot open --version\r\n  --solver-backend=<value>                                - Specifiy the core solver backend to use\r\n    =stp                                                  -   STP (default)\r\n    =metasmt                                              -   metaSMT\r\n\r\n"]
[189.166203, "o", "\u001b[92m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[?25l"]
