[211.971927, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe required KLEE checks pass. For completeness, I'll see whether a full STP executable (with `--version`) can be built; if the needed Boost library is already \r\npresent, I'll install it without disturbing the working KLEE setup.\r\n\r\n```\r\nldconfig -p | grep -i boost_program_options || true; ls /usr/lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/libboost_program_options* 2>/dev/null || true; dpkg -l | grep -E \r\n'libboost.*(program|dev)' | head -20\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠼\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
