[234.450173, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe full STP CLI built successfully and reports its version. I'll update the environment to expose it and verify KLEE still executes correctly using the full \r\nSTP library.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncp ~/.bashrc ~/.bashrc.before-stp-full\r\npython3 - <<'PY'\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\np = Path.home() / '.bashrc'\r\ns = p.read_text()\r\ns = s.replace('/opt/klee/bin:/opt/klee/stp/bin:/opt/klee/minisat/bin', '/opt/klee/bin:/opt/klee/stp-full/bin:/opt/klee/minisat/bin')\r\ns = s.replace('/opt/klee/lib:/opt/klee/stp/lib:/opt/klee/minisat/lib', '/opt/klee/lib:/opt/klee/stp-full/lib:/opt/klee/stp/lib:/opt/klee/minisat/lib')\r\np.write_text(s)\r\nPY\r\nhead -5 ~/.bashrc\r\necho '--- verify fresh source + full stp'; /bin/bash -c 'source ~/.bashrc; command -v klee; command -v stp; stp --version 2>&1 | head -2; klee --version | head \r\n-5'\r\necho '--- rerun symbolic smoke test with updated env'; rm -rf /tmp/klee-smoke2 && mkdir -p /tmp/klee-smoke2 && cd /tmp/klee-smoke2\r\ninfo=$(/bin/bash -c 'source ~/.bashrc; cd /tmp/klee-smoke2; clang-16 -emit-llvm -c -g -O0 -Xclang -disable-O0-optnone /tmp/klee-smoke/test.c -o test.bc; klee \r\n--output-dir=/tmp/klee-smoke2/out test.bc' 2>&1); rc=$?; echo \"$info\"; echo \"exit=$rc\"; find /tmp/klee-smoke2/out -name '*.ktest' | wc -l\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠼\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[234.450483, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠼\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[234.549586, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[234.550438, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\n# KLEE symbolic execution tool environment\r\nexport PATH=\"/opt/klee/bin:/opt/klee/stp-full/bin:/opt/klee/minisat/bin${PATH:+:$PATH}\"\r\nexport CPATH=\"/opt/klee/include${CPATH:+:$CPATH}\"\r\nexport LD_LIBRARY_PATH=\"/opt/klee/lib:/opt/klee/stp-full/lib:/opt/klee/stp/lib:/opt/klee/minisat/lib${LD_LIBRARY_PATH:+:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH}\"\r\n# ~/.bashrc: executed by bash(1) for non-login shells.\r\n--- verify fresh source + full stp\r\n/opt/klee/bin/klee\r\n/opt/klee/stp-full/bin/stp\r\nSTP version 2.3.3\r\nSTP version SHA string d70085462f07c8a5a2f1225f727cda3ef505b141\r\nKLEE 3.3 (https://klee-se.org/)\r\n  Build mode: Release (Asserts: ON)\r\n  Build revision: 74f49f1d243f0e1692a00ac688a7b805b37c5646\r\n\r\nUbuntu LLVM version 16.0.6\r\n--- rerun symbolic smoke test with updated env\r\nKLEE: output directory is \"/tmp/klee-smoke2/out\"\r\nKLEE: Using STP solver backend\r\nKLEE: SAT solver: MiniSat\r\nKLEE: Deterministic allocator: Using quarantine queue size 8\r\nKLEE: Deterministic allocator: globals (start-address=0xf24c14800000 size=10 GiB)\r\nKLEE: Deterministic allocator: constants (start-address=0xf24994800000 size=10 GiB)\r\nKLEE: Deterministic allocator: heap (start-address=0xf14994800000 size=1024 GiB)\r\nKLEE: Deterministic allocator: stack (start-address=0xf12994800000 size=128 GiB)\r\nKLEE: Deterministic allocator: Using quarantine queue size 8\r\nKLEE: Deterministic allocator: globals (start-address=0xf12714800000 size=10 GiB)\r\nKLEE: Deterministic allocator: constants (start-address=0xf12494800000 size=10 GiB)\r\nKLEE: Deterministic allocator: heap (start-address=0xf02494800000 size=1024 GiB)\r\nKLEE: Deterministic allocator: stack (start-address=0xf00494800000 size=128 GiB)\r\n\r\nKLEE: done: total instructions = 16\r\nKLEE: done: completed paths = 2\r\nKLEE: done: partially completed paths = 0\r\nKLEE: done: generated tests = 2\r\nexit=0\r\n2\r\n\r\n"]
