[239.970159, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m29\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[239.970788, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe full STP CLI is installed and KLEE still works with STP/MiniSat. I'll do a final verification from a clean, non-interactive Bash environment that only \r\nsources `~/.bashrc`, matching the test procedure.\r\n\r\n```\r\nenv -i HOME=/root PATH=/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin bash --noprofile --norc -c '\r\n  source ~/.bashrc\r\n  echo \"klee=$(command -v klee)\"\r\n  echo \"stp=$(command -v stp)\"\r\n  echo \"CPATH=$CPATH\"\r\n  echo \"LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$LD_LIBRARY_PATH\"\r\n  test -f \"${CPATH%%:*}/klee/klee.h\" && echo \"header=$CPATH/klee/klee.h\"\r\n  printf \"#include <klee/klee.h>\\nint main(void){ int x; klee_make_symbolic(&x,sizeof(x),\\\"x\\\"); return x == 0; }\\n\" > /tmp/final_klee_test.c\r\n  clang-16 -emit-llvm -c -g -O0 -Xclang -disable-O0-optnone /tmp/final_klee_test.c -o /tmp/final_klee_test.bc\r\n  rm -rf /tmp/final-klee-out\r\n  klee --output-dir=/tmp/final-klee-out /tmp/final_klee_test.bc > /tmp/final_klee_run.log 2>&1\r\n  grep -E \"Using STP solver backend|generated tests\" /tmp/final_klee_run.log\r\n  test \"$(find /tmp/final-klee-out -name \"*.ktest\" | wc -l)\" -ge 1\r\n  echo FINAL_VERIFICATION_OK\r\n'\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
